# 4-bit ALU

## Description
This project implements a 4-bit Arithmetic Logic Unit (ALU) in Verilog.

The ALU performs arithmetic and logical operations based on a 3-bit select input.

## Operations

| sel | Operation |
|------|-----------|
| 000 | Addition (A + B) |
| 001 | Subtraction (A - B) |
| 010 | AND |
| 011 | OR |
| 100 | XOR |
| 101 | NOT A |
| 110 | Left Shift (A << 1) |
| 111 | Right Shift (A >> 1) |

## Inputs

- A [3:0]
- B [3:0]
- sel [2:0]

## Output

- Y [3:0]

